       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TRIPARTITE-GLOSSARY-QUAL-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TRIPARTITE-STRUCTURE.
           05  WS-ELEMENT1-VM-REGISTER-CTX PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ELEMENT2-MATH-FUNCTION   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ELEMENT3-VISUAL-MANIFEST PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE15-ALL-TERMS-CONFORM PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GLOSSARY-STABILITY-MET   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-GLOSSARY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-TRIPARTITE-QUAL-MET      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-GLOSSARY-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-AUDIT-REGISTER-CONTEXT.
           PERFORM 2000-AUDIT-MATH-TRANSFORMATIONS.
           PERFORM 3000-AUDIT-GEOMETRIC-MANIFEST.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-GLOSSARY-QUAL.
           GOBACK.
       1000-AUDIT-REGISTER-CONTEXT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ELEMENT1-VM-REGISTER-CTX.
       2000-AUDIT-MATH-TRANSFORMATIONS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ELEMENT2-MATH-FUNCTION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE15-ALL-TERMS-CONFORM.
       3000-AUDIT-GEOMETRIC-MANIFEST.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ELEMENT3-VISUAL-MANIFEST.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GLOSSARY-STABILITY-MET.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-GLOSSARY-QUAL.
           IF WS-ELEMENT1-VM-REGISTER-CTX = 1 AND
              WS-ELEMENT2-MATH-FUNCTION = 1 AND
              WS-ELEMENT3-VISUAL-MANIFEST = 1 AND
              WS-RULE15-ALL-TERMS-CONFORM = 1 AND
              WS-GLOSSARY-STABILITY-MET = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TRIPARTITE-QUAL-MET
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-GLOSSARY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TRIPARTITE-QUAL-MET
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-GLOSSARY-CODE.
